B.T2=new A.bv(B.c8,[B.QX,'\ud83d\udd04 Here\'s how a swap works:\n\n1. Browse the Feed for skill posts\n2. Tap a post that interests you\n3. Hit "Start Chat & Swap"\n4. Chat with the person and agree on details\n5. Tap "Confirm Swap" inside the chat\n6. Complete the swap in real life\n7. Tap "Mark Done" and rate each other!'],t.yf)
