B.T6=new A.bv(B.c8,[B.QT,'\ud83d\udcdd To create a post:\n\n1. Tap the + button in the bottom nav\n2. Fill in your skill title & description\n3. Add the skill you\'re offering\n4. Choose exchange type:\n   \u2022 Barter (skill for skill)\n   \u2022 Custom (money, treats, etc.)\n5. Add tags like "Urgent" or "Online"\n6. Tap "Publish Skill Post"'],t.yf)
